stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Prepared
    Prepared --> Approved: explicit exact-payload grant
    Approved --> Prepared: expiry or dependency changed
    Approved --> Submitting: durable intent and atomic grant consumption
    Submitting --> Confirmed: qualifying receipt evidence
    Submitting --> Uncertain: possible write with missing acknowledgement
    Uncertain --> Confirmed: scoped reconciliation finds receipt
    Uncertain --> ExternalAttested: candidate attestation retained as such
    Uncertain --> Prepared: deliberate candidate retry decision recorded
    Prepared --> Canceled: before external write
    Confirmed --> [*]
    note right of Uncertain
      Never automatically retry.
      Exactly-once external delivery is not guaranteed.
    end note
